2. Minecraft (Java Edition and Bedrock Edition)
----------------------------------------------
Copyright Mojang AB / Microsoft. Proprietary. Governed by the Minecraft EULA:
https://www.minecraft.net/en-us/article/minecraft-eula

The compiled client that this layer runs inside contains Mojang's game code and
assets. This repository distributes no playable client: pack.mjs takes the
official client file as user-supplied input and leaves that file's own bytes
untouched apart from the injected script block.


